          "partOfSpeech": "verb"
        },
        {
          "text": "To be filled with envious feelings; to regard anything with grudging and longing eyes; -- used especially with at. Who would envy at the prosperity of the wicked Jer. Taylor.",
          "partOfSpeech": "verb"
